# npm pack exclusion for the init/ template directory.
#
# npm pack uses DISK state (a pass-4/7 lesson): the root package.json files
# whitelist includes init/, so everything on disk under it ships -- including
# 13MB of node_modules and build output from example-templating work done in
# this tree. host installs only need the template source, never deps or build
# artifacts; a real user project regenerates both itself.
node_modules/
dist/
.prestruct/
